{"data": [{"created_at": "2026-10-26T02:27:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114544489192968487"], "id": "2114544489192968487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 43, "impression_count": 72278, "like_count": 499, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 89, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "Has anyone personally here experienced the iPhone Duo cracked screen problem? If so, DM me.", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114544489192968487"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114477188192051200"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:00:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114477194873561273"], "id": "2114477194873561273", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 315, "impression_count": 243855, "like_count": 4516, "quote_count": 42, "reply_count": 140, "retweet_count": 159}, "text": "Everyone failed to point out the real problem with the iPhone Duo lacking Face ID: You can\u2019t buy a Vision Pro with it. https://t.co/WKEgEphCQ9", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114477194873561273"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T16:06:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114388027028177273"], "id": "2114388027028177273", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 77, "impression_count": 115724, "like_count": 1334, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 59, "retweet_count": 53}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114359435858776134", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Also coming is the M6 base 14-inch MacBook Pro, new iMac and OLED iPad mini. Apple finishes up its 2026 product road map with a banger. https://t.co/rId5cS8EyU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114388027028177273"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T15:13:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114374850479542556"], "id": "2114374850479542556", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 95, "impression_count": 144147, "like_count": 1312, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 87, "retweet_count": 26}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114262930711560305", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Yep. Returned the Folio last night. https://t.co/Yqk1oLFLZ7", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114374850479542556"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T14:21:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114361768265089161"], "id": "2114361768265089161", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 38670, "like_count": 206, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "Also in Power On: Apple\u2019s latest hardware leadership reshuffle: longtime display chiefs are moving toward retirement, new engineering VPs are named and wireless executives are gaining influence. https://t.co/FCfPFQGmwg", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114361768265089161"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T14:20:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114361432812949872"], "id": "2114361432812949872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 36152, "like_count": 276, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "Also in Power On: Apple is rolling out a new retail tool that scans sealed iPhone boxes, runs diagnostics and helps prevent theft without turning returned products into wasted inventory. https://t.co/XSKU6yTysQ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114361432812949872"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T14:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114361063986942284"], "id": "2114361063986942284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 357, "impression_count": 302032, "like_count": 2943, "quote_count": 32, "reply_count": 102, "retweet_count": 81}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114359435858776134", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Within Apple, Cook and Ternus both felt that customers had begun to expect touch screens on Macs. But the company\u2019s industrial design team remained opposed to the idea. The compromise was to create a device where touch was an option but not the primary interface. https://t.co/rId5cS8EyU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114361063986942284"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T14:17:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114360764958138728"], "id": "2114360764958138728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 238, "impression_count": 181845, "like_count": 1729, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 67, "retweet_count": 68}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114359435858776134", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Details on Wednesday\u2019s MacBook Pro launch: OLED, Dynamic Island, lighter designs, higher prices and a touch-optimized macOS. Plus, why Apple is making the reversal, how the Mac lineup is changing and what comes next. https://t.co/rId5cS8EyU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114360764958138728"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-25T14:12:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114359435858776134"], "id": "2114359435858776134", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 133, "impression_count": 590667, "like_count": 1110, "quote_count": 40, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 72}, "text": "Power On: Apple\u2019s touch-screen MacBook Pro will arrive on Wednesday, marking the tech giant\u2019s latest major reversal. https://t.co/P4M498jUTQ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114359435858776134"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-24T03:08:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113830069462581722"], "id": "2113830069462581722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 38, "impression_count": 99251, "like_count": 1060, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 86, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "So far I prefer the standard iPhone Duo case to the Folio. The kickstand on the folio is nice but the flap on top of the outer screen and how it covers the outside display when using camera preview just make it pretty inconvenient.", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113830069462581722"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113691582910398464"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:58:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113691597905047995"], "id": "2113691597905047995", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 67, "impression_count": 81808, "like_count": 3159, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 37, "retweet_count": 37}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113690779730456675", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "As for me https://t.co/Ub96dREoZn https://t.co/lo88XjxUZ7", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113691597905047995"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T17:55:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113690779730456675"], "id": "2113690779730456675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 120510, "like_count": 380, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "Our Bloomberg iPhone Duo review, written by @chriswelch https://t.co/HneteVmzC6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113690779730456675"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T14:55:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113645403287789728"], "id": "2113645403287789728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 150, "impression_count": 181637, "like_count": 1929, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 79, "retweet_count": 46}, "text": "Seems like in the end - depending on market - Apple dramatically limited store pick up pre-orders in favor of walk-in inventory. Have also heard some stores holding back inventory (or getting more shipments) for Saturday. In terms of today, 50-200 units on average I\u2019d say.", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113645403287789728"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T12:46:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113612991082164336"], "id": "2113612991082164336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 79007, "like_count": 1176, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 27}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113611066492232096", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Ternus toured Apple\u2019s offices in Austin yesterday and Formula 1 is there this weekend, so that\u2019s why he\u2019s there instead of 5th ave. https://t.co/b5CSxra98w", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113612991082164336"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T12:38:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113611066492232096"], "id": "2113611066492232096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 114288, "like_count": 587, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113609837271789704", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Ternus in Texas https://t.co/J6ntBR8hva", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113611066492232096"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T12:35:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113610336096141692"], "id": "2113610336096141692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 93, "impression_count": 131957, "like_count": 2126, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 44, "retweet_count": 70}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113609421314031991", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Original iPhone had a dock, SIM ejector, cleaning cloth, charging brick, cable and headphones. Believe it or not, that\u2019s now like $150 of separate purchases. https://t.co/fpNUALQYdH", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113610336096141692"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T12:30:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113609009265778944"], "id": "2113609009265778944", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 270, "impression_count": 227766, "like_count": 4916, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 46, "retweet_count": 102}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113607643700822062", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Here\u2019s the personalized first boot on the Duo https://t.co/7jv2JgaKjc", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113609009265778944"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T12:09:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113603637729714237"], "id": "2113603637729714237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 41629, "like_count": 281, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113602509440979065", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Seems plausible Ternus and O\u2019Brien will be at another store. Three hours to go for the west coast. https://t.co/O3gK2yzpsu", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113603637729714237"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T12:04:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113602509440979065"], "id": "2113602509440979065", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 151, "impression_count": 196471, "like_count": 1745, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 45}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113601900906254842", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Super strange - No Ternus. Also, Vanessa Trigub instead of Deirdre O\u2019Brien. She\u2019s the somewhat newly named head of retail stores and likely O\u2019Brien\u2019s eventual successor. https://t.co/RbI0HLpKDp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113602509440979065"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T02:14:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113453964515831915"], "id": "2113453964515831915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 92, "impression_count": 176063, "like_count": 896, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113453446791872600", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Also, the fact that this isn\u2019t a thing already probably tells you how secure the facial recognition is on the HomeView. https://t.co/Jko2UGW5sU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113453964515831915"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-23T02:12:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113453446791872600"], "id": "2113453446791872600", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 64, "impression_count": 273063, "like_count": 1121, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 52, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "This seems like it would never happen for 1,000 reasons but have to wonder if the Touch ID discourse continues if Apple considers adding HomeView-like facial recognition to the iPhone Duo with very specific parameters like requiring Touch ID or PIN hourly or some such.", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113453446791872600"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-22T21:41:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385333291188518"], "id": "2113385333291188518", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 81365, "like_count": 656, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 33}, "text": "I mentioned during today's podcast two features Apple has tested for the iPhone Duo 2: under-display Face ID on the front screen and an Action Button. https://t.co/MUP8gF5GAx", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113385333291188518"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-22T17:33:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113322851054780725"], "id": "2113322851054780725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 45858, "like_count": 97, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113264860419256427", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "YouTube Link: https://t.co/rnV0gkLEUp https://t.co/lVAnqhncKc", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113322851054780725"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-22T17:24:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113320489297096921"], "id": "2113320489297096921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 63133, "like_count": 203, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113264860419256427", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Make sure you watch @AndruEdwards full review of the Duo https://t.co/yqoTOmkYvV. We\u2019ll have our full review at Bloomberg live very soon. https://t.co/lVAnqhnKzK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113320489297096921"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-22T13:42:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113264860419256427"], "id": "2113264860419256427", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 73174, "like_count": 182, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "NEW: Episode 4 of the Power On podcast is out! I\u2019m joined by @AndruEdwards to go deep on the iPhone Duo after a week of testing: what\u2019s great, what\u2019s missing and what\u2019s next. We also discuss the pre-order mess and preview next week\u2019s touch Mac launch. https://t.co/MUP8gF6eq5", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2113264860419256427"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114477188192051200", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113691582910398464", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2114544489192968487", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g73u77z1yjjym46v0raxkf65vb", "oldest_id": "2113264860419256427", "result_count": 25}}